# Insights and AI

- The app must work with `AI_API_KEY` empty. `DeterministicRulesProvider` is the default and fallback.
- LLM output may only rephrase language. It never sets or changes `estimatedFinancialImpact`, severity, confidence, metrics, or references.
- Validate all model output with Zod (`parseInsightLanguage`); on mismatch keep the deterministic text.
- Providers return drafts only — no repository imports, no SQL, no mutations. Persistence goes through `insight-service`.
- Inject `fetchImpl` so tests never hit the network.

Full guidance: `.cursor/skills/facilityiq-insights-ai/SKILL.md`.
